@param preferredBackupWindow The daily time range during which automated backups are created if automated backups are enabled using the <code>BackupRetentionPeriod</code> parameter. </p> <p>The default is a 30-minute window selected at random from an 8-hour block of time for each AWS Region. To view the time blocks available, see <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/Aurora.Managing.Backups.html#Aurora.Managing.Backups.BackupWindow"> Backup window</a> in the <i>Amazon Aurora User Guide.</i> </p> <p>Constraints:</p> <ul> <li> <p>Must be in the format <code>hh24:mi-hh24:mi</code>.</p> </li> <li> <p>Must be in Universal Coordinated Time (UTC).</p> </li> <li> <p>Must not conflict with the preferred maintenance window.</p> </li> <li> <p>Must be at least 30 minutes.</p> </li>
